    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Genevieve M.",
        "date": "2025-09-28T20:13:50Z",
        "id": "68d9a521fec87d2474df7eda",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 13, 2025",
            "id": "d7581df5-7964-4cba-a6bd-720657e31bd9",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind and thoughtful review! We’re thrilled to hear that you and your group loved the home, its location, and the easy access to the beach. It’s wonderful to know the space made such a great impression and that you’d love to return.\n\nWe truly appreciate your feedback regarding the fire feature by the pool. We understand how disappointing that must have been, especially after seeing it in the photos. The gas connection has since been addressed, and we’re making sure everything is clearly communicated for future guests so expectations align perfectly.\n\nYour comments help us continue improving, and we’d be honored to host you again for another amazing stay!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Absolutely gorgeous and amazing home and property. Perfect location and access to the beach. Everyone was blown away and we all loved our stay. only disappointment was how much we were looking forward to lighting the fire by the pool shown in the photos and after a long time of trying to get this fire pit to work we called someone with the property to come out which they were very prompt, however it appeared that the gas had been disconnected and was never going to work, so that was disappointing based on the photos and our expectations. And the property manager that came out seemed to be confused. A very minor complaint overall and otherwise would still 100% go back there again and again. The home is really spectacular.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
